  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Exploring Your Options for Replacing a Missing Tooth: The Advantage of Dental Implants\n\n\nJune 14, 2024\n\n\n#### Share This Post\n\n\nAt our dental office, we understand that losing a tooth can be a traumatic experience with impacts that extend far beyond aesthetics. A missing tooth in McLean, VA can create complications, including difficulty chewing, speaking clearly, and even drifting adjacent teeth into the void left by the missing tooth. It also can lead to bone loss around the disappeared spot. We empathize with these challenges and the associated distress they bring to people. Hence, we are here to examine and tackle the situation as early as possible, offering our understanding and care every step of the way.\n\n\n## The Various Options for Tooth Replacement in McLean, VA\n\n\nThankfully, advancements in modern dentistry have provided many viable solutions to replace a missing tooth or even multiple teeth. These options include dentures, which are artificial teeth and gums tailored to fit your mouth; bridges, that ‘bridge’ the gap where one or more teeth might be absent; and dental implants, which consist of an artificial tooth root placed into your jaw to hold a replacement tooth or bridge. Each option has its pros and cons and should be considered carefully.\n\n\n## Why Dental Implants are an Excellent Choice\n\n\nAmong the various options, dental implants stand out for several reasons. They offer strength and durability comparable to natural teeth, providing a permanent solution not prone to decay. An implant replenishes the tooth from root to crown, maintaining bone levels and preventing the shifting of adjacent teeth. Moreover, unlike dentures, they do not require additional removal or maintenance beyond regular brushing and flossing. With dental implants, you can feel confident in your smile, knowing you have chosen a long-lasting and reliable solution.\n\n\n## The Process of Getting a Dental Implant\n\n\nWe offer a comprehensive process for dental implants in McLean, VA. This starts with an initial consultation to assess your oral health and suitability for the procedure. The implant is then placed, onto which a replacement tooth is mounted. Aftercare includes regular check-ups and maintaining good oral hygiene.\n\nWe aim to provide top-quality dental care using the latest technology and procedures. In addition to dental implants, we offer various services to improve and maintain oral health. Our experienced team is dedicated to ensuring a comfortable and successful experience with any procedure you undergo.\n\n\n## Choose An Expert For Your Dental Implants!\n\n\nWe possess the expertise and skills necessary for such complex procedures, and our team is committed to patient comfort and well-being. From our state-of-the-art facilities to our responsive and caring staff, we make it our mission to help you regain your beautiful smile. With us, you can feel secure, knowing that you are in the hands of experienced professionals dedicated to your oral health.\n\nReady to take the next step towards a confident smile? With Dr. Nahlah, you’re in safe hands. Renowned for our expertise, dedication to patient care, and proven results, we excel in dental implant procedures. Please no longer delay your smile transformation; contact our McLean, VA office today to schedule!\n\nPrevPreviousDiscovering the Benefits and Process of Snap-On Dentures in McLean, VA\n\nNextNavigating the World of Dental Implants: An Expert’s GuideNext\n\n\n#### More To Explore\n\n\n\n### Unlock the Benefits of Dental Implants: Your Best Teeth Replacement Option\n\n\nTooth loss can become an unfortunate reality for many as we age. Thankfully, advancements in dental technology, like dental implants,\n\nRead More »\n\nOctober 26, 2024\n\n\n### Your Comprehensive Guide on Dental Implants: The Best Replacement of Tooth Solution\n\n\nDental implants in McLean, VA are small, and titanium posts are surgically placed in your jawbone underneath your gum line.\n\nOctober 20, 2024\n\n\n## You Are Welcome Here.\n\n\nSchedule your consultation today.\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
